---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';

// Public page, also while the shop is locked. Linked from the footer
// (admin → Teksten → Footer).
const email = 'amirdessouky@gmail.com';
---

<LegalPage
    title="privacy policy"
    file="privacy.txt"
>
    <p class="block-legal-updated">Last updated: 24 November 2026</p>
    <p>
        This privacy policy describes how your personal information is collected, used and shared when you visit or make a purchase from
        southsidedinero.com (the "Site").
    </p>

    <h2>Personal information we collect</h2>
    <p>
        When you visit the Site, our server keeps short technical logs: your IP address, browser type and the date and time of your visit. We use
        these only to keep the Site running and secure. We do not use analytics, advertising pixels or other tracking tools.
    </p>
    <p>The Site uses only what it needs to work:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>a cookie that remembers you entered the password before a drop (kept for 60 days);</li>
        <li>your cart and chosen shipping country, stored in your own browser so they are still there when you come back.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        When you make or try to make a purchase, we collect your name, email address, phone number, shipping address and what you ordered. We
        refer to this as "Order Information". Payments are handled by Stripe: we never see or store your card or bank details.
    </p>
    <p>When you sign up for drop updates, we collect your email address.</p>

    <h2>How we use your personal information</h2>
    <p>We use your Order Information to:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>process your payment, ship your order and send you an order confirmation;</li>
        <li>communicate with you about your order, returns and refunds;</li>
        <li>screen orders for potential risk or fraud (through Stripe).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        If you signed up for drop updates, we use your email address to tell you about new drops and releases. You can unsubscribe at any time by
        sending us an email.
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing your personal information</h2>
    <p>We only share your personal information where needed to deliver your order:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            Stripe processes your payment. You can read how Stripe uses your information here:
            <a
                href="https://stripe.com/privacy"
                rel="noopener">https://stripe.com/privacy</a
            >.
        </li>
        <li>The shipping company that delivers your order receives your name and shipping address.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        We never sell your personal information. We may also share your personal information to comply with applicable laws and regulations, to
        respond to a lawful request for information, or to otherwise protect our rights.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>We do not use your personal information for targeted advertising and we do not use advertising trackers on the Site.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
        Under the European privacy law (GDPR) you have the right to access the personal information we hold about you and to ask that it be
        corrected, updated or deleted. You can also object to how we use it. To exercise these rights, contact us using the details below.
    </p>
    <p>
        We process your information to fulfil the contract we have with you (your order), or with your consent (drop updates). Stripe may transfer
        your information outside of Europe, including to the United States, under the safeguards of the GDPR. If you are not happy with how we
        handle your information, you can file a complaint with the Dutch Data Protection Authority (Autoriteit Persoonsgegevens).
    </p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>
        We keep your Order Information as long as Dutch tax law requires us to keep our records (7 years). Your email address for drop updates is
        kept until you unsubscribe.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time, for example to reflect changes to our practices or for other operational, legal or
        regulatory reasons.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>
        For more information about our privacy practices, if you have questions, or if you would like to make a complaint, please email us at
        <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.
    </p>
    <p>southsidedinero.com</p>
</LegalPage>
